description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"写真、いっぱい 撮ってきたけど…… こうして撮られるのは初めて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"こういうとき、どうしたらいいか 分からない……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"こう、笑えばいいのかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"もっとお花のほうに寄る……？ わかった。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ハマナス…… いいにおい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"偶然見つけた場所だけど…… 先生のおかげで、ここに来れた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ありがとう先生。 素敵な思い出になったよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_MemorialLobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生の隣にいるね。 ……なんとなく、そうしたいの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生には、いつももらってばかり。 私からもいろいろ、したいのに……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ふふ、ありがとう。 記念に写真、撮っておくね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"あっ、こういうときは……ちゃんとお礼を、だったね。 はい、こちらこそ、よろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_Birthday","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ありがとう、先生。 プレゼントは大丈夫……  それより、 一緒に散歩してほしい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_Birthday.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとう、先生。 今日はプレゼントを渡す日、 だよね。覚えてるよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_Birthday_Player_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"プレゼントに……私はどうかな？ 今日一日は、先生の言う事、 なんでも聞くよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_Birthday_Player_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"いたずら……お菓子……？ ごめん、ハロウィーンの ことはまだ、よく知らなくて。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_Halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"だから先生に、 教えてもらいたい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_Halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_NewYear_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"明けましておめでとう、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_NewYear_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_NewYear_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"新しい年…… 今年はなにが起こるのか、 楽しみだね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_NewYear_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Season_Xmas","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"メリークリスマス、先生。 特別な日は、写真にしなきゃ。  はい、こっち見て。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Season_Xmas.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ブルー、アーカイブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Title.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"いい写真、撮れるかな？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"（サッちゃん、元気にしてるといいな）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"どこかで、お花の香りがする。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"ここ、ゆっくりできそう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0267_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"これは……？初めてみた。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/CH0267_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"確認した。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0267_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"呼んでくれてうれしい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/jp/ch0267_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0267_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0267_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0267_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0267_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0267_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0267_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E7%A7%A4%20%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%A5%E5%AD%90/%E6%B3%B3%E8%A3%85/kr/ch0267_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0267_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"","text_origi